# Third-party sources, committed on purpose. CPM caches every pinned release
# archive here (cmake/dependencies.cmake) so a configured build never touches
# the network. It is 98M against src/'s 12M, and its 714 .c / 712 .h files
# from SQLite, curl and Lua outweigh the first-party C++26 eight to one by
# size -- without this, GitHub's language bar can report this repository as C.
#
# Linguist's own heuristics likely exclude a top-level vendor/ already; this
# states it rather than relying on that, because the failure mode is silent
# and the fix costs one line.
vendor/** linguist-vendored=true
